### 1. Login (Success - Admin user)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3001/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 2. Login (Failed - Wrong Password)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### 3. Get All Authors
GET http://localhost:3001/api/authors

### 4. Get All Categories
GET http://localhost:3001/api/categories

### 5. Get All Books
GET http://localhost:3001/api/books

### 6. Get Books Filtered by Category
GET http://localhost:3001/api/books?categoryId=2

### 7. Get Books Filtered by Author
GET http://localhost:3001/api/books?authorId=1

### 8. Get Single Book by ID
GET http://localhost:3001/api/books/1

### 9. Create Book (Failed - Missing Auth Token -> 401)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Refactoring",
  "isbn": "978-0201485677",
  "published_year": 1999,
  "category_id": 2,
  "author_ids": [3]
}

### 10. Create Book (Failed - Invalid Category ID -> 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/books
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Refactoring",
  "isbn": "978-0201485677",
  "published_year": 1999,
  "category_id": 9999,
  "author_ids": [1]
}

### 11. Create Book (Success - Requires Auth -> 201 Created)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/books
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Design Patterns",
  "isbn": "978-0201633610",
  "published_year": 1994,
  "category_id": 2,
  "author_ids": [1]
}

### 12. Delete Book (Failed - Missing Auth Token -> 401)
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/books/1

### 13. Delete Book (Success - Requires Auth -> 204 No Content)
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/books/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
